#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:465
#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:538
msgid "Threshold Settings"
msgstr "임계값 설정"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:399
msgid "Threshold minFraud Risk Score"
msgstr "최소 사기 위험 점수 임계값"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:401
#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:474
#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:547
msgid ""
"If the risk score returned by the minFraud system exceeds this number, the "
"transaction will be considered potentially fraudulent and will contribute to "
"the overall fraud score calculation.  If the risk score from minFraud is "
"lower than this threshold, it will not contribute to the overall fraud score."
msgstr ""
"minFraud 시스템에서 반환된 위험 점수가 이 숫자를 초과하는 경우 해당 거래는 잠"
"재적인 사기로 간주되어 전체 사기 점수 계산에 반영됩니다. minFraud의 위험 점수"
"가 이 임계값보다 낮으면 전체 사기 점수에 영향을 미치지 않습니다."

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:414
msgid "minFraud Rule Weight"
msgstr "minFraud 규칙 가중치"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:417
#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:490
#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:563
msgid ""
"If the minFraud risk score exceeds the threshold set above, this weight will "
"be applied to the overall risk score.  By adjusting this, you can balance "
"the minFraud value against the other rules-based calculations in the plugin."
msgstr ""
"minFraud 위험 점수가 위에 설정된 임계값을 초과하는 경우 이 가중치가 전체 위"
"험 점수에 적용됩니다. 이를 조정하면 플러그인의 다른 규칙 기반 계산과 "
"minFraud 값의 균형을 맞출 수 있습니다."

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:455
msgid "Enable MaxMind minFraud Insights Integration"
msgstr "MaxMind minFraud Insights 통합 활성화"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:472
