msgstr "임계값 minFraud Insights 위험 점수"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:487
msgid "minFraud Insights Rule Weight"
msgstr "minFraud Insights 규칙 가중치"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:528
